  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_5_017kir_1_5_017_03:1_5_017_03:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c391997b55a2964fa0fc166f4cc2e2a84ff43baeb6237ada6e314982654dd101",
      "text": "工作中",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_017kir_1_5_017_03:1_5_017_03:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5d3e8fa043af75a87dd4faef01ce8885090903c7489ecb33e70005fc16c71c5",
      "text": "【剧情梗概】",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_017kir_1_5_017_03:1_5_017_03:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33d8451285d4e5f69626e1f5771ddc007ba751ec655f29067561078d2496c78f",
      "text": "工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_017kir_1_5_017_03:1_5_017_03:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:30f14293fc1fbde1496c5153330b76e1da3cca15f0c0146692887696afbbf6f2",
      "text": "问答综艺节目嘉宾的工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_017kir_1_5_017_03:1_5_017_03:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8661bdaac7f48182bf3391cfb888933ee3457adf150967a3b8ee1a3eacda8a4",
      "text": "桐生先生，这是下次作为嘉宾出演的\n问答综艺节目的资料。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_017kir_1_5_017_03:1_5_017_03:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6018083fb37804291b570f32f13b89e93c3cf82e5703c80eff6e01aa30d9e73b",
      "text": "多谢喵，\n●●●●プロデューサー君。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_017kir_1_5_017_03:1_5_017_03:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51f58e6165a9629ea04de83d0e4fb600efd4a12324f9e55dbe86c40c5df1217a",
      "text": "桐生先生出演的这期，\n是介绍世界各地的动物的内容。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_017kir_1_5_017_03:1_5_017_03:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5aaa9a5d7a336a54d10f09a0740695637af46af006cd88c6df47b2d49051181b",
      "text": "世界各地的动物……！啾哔哔地\n预感要涌现出新的小段子了喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_017kir_1_5_017_03:1_5_017_03:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23c64697c6101ace5655953ec19b39706b0fa1b75845caede56be34fd8dc634c",
      "text": "录制的时候，据说会有动物来到演播室。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_017kir_1_5_017_03:1_5_017_03:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aff51b1e03b6a40d813cbe2dfcef5e5948f16b0449cbeec208a504f8d6bd2cba",
      "text": "喵、喵什么！吾辈本来就很喜欢\n观察人和生物。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_017kir_1_5_017_03:1_5_017_03:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:045c051f7ed4c28283fa127136cecc5a979440a15717f3cf82f200534364c4a6",
      "text": "这可是能近距离观察\n世界各地动物的大好机会喵～♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_017kir_1_5_017_03:1_5_017_03:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9a87cbb2b15efaaedd8c5fe03c70d5ce8a73692ff267c890ed5bd87a9e35cfe",
      "text": "话说，●●●●プロデューサー君。\n会有什么动物来演播室喵？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_017kir_1_5_017_03:1_5_017_03:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c458865529c49a0e3925825ef999834db1b62dcc6e774d84643132216c7bc83c",
      "text": "那个好像还在协调中。\n听说有可能直到当天最后一刻都定不下来呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_017kir_1_5_017_03:1_5_017_03:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:26d8069508b4038def28098ea329bb4ea9a3e0b346ee8154ea077b49a4af496b",
      "text": "去到现场之前都不知道……那也别有一番趣味是也。\n真期待收录喵♪",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
